ology"},{"type":"h","text":"Epigraphy + Palaeography"},{"type":"h","text":"Epigraphy Researcher / Specialist"}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Relevant postgraduate areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Archaeology"},{"text":"Classical Studies"},{"text":"Heritage Studies"},{"text":"Museum Studies"},{"text":"Conservation"},{"text":"Digital Humanities"},{"text":"Archaeological Science"},{"text":"Ancient Civilisations"},{"text":"Manuscript Studies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful interdisciplinary areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology + GIS"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology + Remote Sensing"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology + Digital Humanities"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology + Conservation Science"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A possible pathway is:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Sanskrit"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology/Research Intern"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology Assistant / Research Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Research/Field Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeologist / Heritage Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Archaeologist / Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Project Director / Senior Heritage Specialist / Academic Researcher"},{"type":"p","text":"Progression depends heavily on qualifications, recruitment rules, research experience and specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Epigraphy","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Sanskrit Graduate"},{"type":"flow","items":["Epigraphy Assistant","Research Assistant","Epigraphist / Epigraphy Specialist","Senior Researcher","Academic/Research Leadership"]},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest niche pathways for a Sanskrit graduate."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Museum","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Sanskrit"},{"type":"flow","items":["Museum Assistant","Collections/Documentation Assistant","Museum Professional","Curator/Collections Specialist","Museum Management"]},{"type":"p","text":"A relevant postgraduate qualification in Museology/Heritage can strengthen this route."}]},{"heading":"Alternative Career Path — Digital Heritage","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Sanskrit"},{"type":"flow","items":["Heritage Documentation Assistant","GIS/Digital Heritage Assistant","Digital Humanities Specialist","Digital Heritage Project Lead","Cultural Data/Heritage Technology Specialist"]},{"type":"p","text":"This combines traditional humanities knowledge with modern technology."}]},{"heading":"AI & Future Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is increasingly useful in archaeological and heritage research."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OCR of historical documents"},{"text":"Manuscript digitisation"},{"text":"Script recognition"},{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"Artefact recognition"},{"text":"Historical text analysis"},{"text":"Translation assistance"},{"text":"GIS analysis"},{"text":"3D reconstruction"},{"text":"Site documentation"},{"text":"Archaeological pattern detection"},{"text":"Digital preservation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Sanskrit + AI can become particularly interesting in:"},{"type":"flow","items":["OCR","Sanskrit text digitisation","NLP","Searchable historical databases"]},{"type":"p","text":"A student can therefore build a niche around:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sanskrit","Archaeology","Digital Humanities","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Future Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By 2030+, a strong candidate could combine:"},{"type":"h","text":"Humanities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sanskrit"},{"text":"Ancient history"},{"text":"Cultural history"},{"text":"Epigraphy"},{"text":"Manuscriptology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Survey"},{"text":"Excavation"},{"text":"Artefact documentation"},{"text":"Dating concepts"},{"text":"Heritage conservation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GIS"},{"text":"Remote sensing"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Digital archives"},{"text":"Photogrammetry"}]},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"OCR"},{"text":"NLP"},{"text":"Image classification"},{"text":"AI-assisted research"},{"text":"Historical-text processing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a much stronger profile than traditional Sanskrit study alone."}]},{"heading":"Ideal Graduate Profile","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should be able to say:"},{"type":"p","text":"“I have advanced knowledge of Sanskrit and ancient Indian history, understand basic archaeological field methods, can document and research inscriptions and heritage sites, use GIS and digital documentation tools, and can organise historical data for research and digital-heritage projects.”"},{"type":"p","text":"That profile can open opportunities across archaeology, epigraphy, museums, archives, heritage and digital humanities."}]},{"heading":"Best Practical Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BA Sanskrit"},{"type":"flow","items":["Build excellent Sanskrit + English proficiency","Study Ancient Indian History","Learn archaeology fundamentals","Learn epigraphy + palaeography","Gain fieldwork/heritage internship","Learn QGIS + digital documentation","Build an inscription documentation project","Build an archaeological-site GIS database","Develop manuscript/heritage research skills","Apply for:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeology Assistant / Research Assistant / Heritage Assistant / Field Assistant"},{"type":"flow","items":["Pursue M.A./M.Sc. Archaeology, Ancient Indian History & Archaeology, Museology, Heritage or a related specialisation","Gain field/research experience","Specialise in:"]},{"type":"h","text":"Epigraphy / Archaeology / Manuscriptology / Museum Studies / Digital Heritage"},{"type":"p","text":"→ Progress toward:"},{"type":"h","text":"Archaeologist / Epigraphist / Heritage Specialist / Researcher"},{"type":"h","text":"Best AI-era combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sanskrit","Archaeology","Epigraphy","GIS","Digital Humanities","AI/OCR","Research Skills"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular degree-career combination, epigraphy and digital heritage are especially strong specialisations because they directly connect Sanskrit expertise with archaeological evidence while also creating opportunities to use modern technology."}]}]}